tpm2sh (0.15.23-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * Bump Build-Depends: rustc to (>= 1.81) to match Cargo.toml rust-version.
  * Switch to debhelper-compat (= 13) and drop debian/compat.
  * Add pkg-config and libssl-dev to Build-Depends for openssl-sys.
  * Bump Standards-Version to 4.7.2 and declare Rules-Requires-Root: no.

